<content>
Before you do anything else — watch this walkthrough. It shows you how to navigate this workspace, where everything lives, and how to use it daily.
<span color="red">**\[INSERT LOOM WALKTHROUGH VIDEO HERE\]**</span>
- **The Offer** — Full breakdown of what we're selling (pricing, tiers, inclusions)
- **\[Client\]'s Story** — Who the creator is, their background, why prospects trust them
- **Case Studies** — Social proof videos and testimonials to send prospects
- **ICP Cheatsheet** — Who qualifies, who doesn't, red flags
- **Closing Team SOPs** — Scripts, objection handling, no-show/no-close processes, CRM usage
- **Appointment Setters SOPs** — Setter sales process, dialer, booking links, qualification checklist
- **EODs & Forms SOP** — How to fill out your daily end-of-day reports
- **Scripts Hub** — Full setter and closer scripts, customized for this client
- **Performance Standards** — Benchmarks, expectations, what gets you fired
</content>
